# Keep the Docker build context focused on reproducible source and artifact data.
*

!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!docker/
!docker/**
!artifact/
!artifact/**
!rosdep/
!rosdep/**
!rosdep_auditor/
!rosdep_auditor/**
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!STATUS.md
!REQUIREMENTS.md
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
CLAUDE.md

# Local/generated data that is too large or environment-specific for image builds.
rosdep_cache/
logs/
logs copy/
temp/
datas/
dependency_rule_inspector/
*.log
*.out
nohup.out
